# Medieval Architecture – Modding guide

This guide is for authors of other mods who want their materials to work with Medieval Architecture, or who want to use its systems for their own blocks. Everything described here works with JSON only (assets and JSON patches), no code is needed.

Asset domain of this mod: `confession`. Mod id: `medievalarchitecture`.

